{"unit_id":"tiantyu__dsh-skin-toggle#card-zh","repo":"tiantyu/dsh-skin-toggle","commit":"781fd4605756503f9635d6083686e079b5a8944f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skin-toggle 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的皮肤管理插件，通过注入一个可拖动的悬浮按钮，让用户在已安装的网页皮肤之间切换或恢复默认外观。插件从 Cordis Loader 读取符合皮肤包命名约定的条目，并通过 body 属性和样式规则控制皮肤背景与装饰元素的显示。主要功能包括列出并选择皮肤、恢复无皮肤界面、记住当前选择和按钮位置，以及在启动后短暂重申所选状态。适合希望直接在 DSH 网页界面管理多套皮肤的用户；需要 DSH Web 和遵循约定的皮肤包，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:221-281","lib/client.js:303-355","lib/client.js:390-507"]}
{"unit_id":"tiantyu__dsh-skin-toggle#card-en","repo":"tiantyu/dsh-skin-toggle","commit":"781fd4605756503f9635d6083686e079b5a8944f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skin-toggle adds a draggable button to DSH Web for switching installed skins or restoring the default look. It finds matching skins in the Cordis Loader, saves the selected skin and button position in localStorage, and restores them at startup. Requires compatible skin packages; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:221-281","lib/client.js:303-355","lib/client.js:390-507"]}
